      "text": "Israel -- The sin of Achan and its results teach the great truth of the oneness of the people of God, Joshua 7:11. \"Israel hath sinned.\" See in illustration; 1 Corinthians 5:1-7; 12:12-14,26. The whole cause of Christ is injured by the sin, neglect, or unspirituality of one believer."
